<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>特征工程与数据集</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BBD0EF' }}>02 · 系统设计</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', padding: 32, gap: 28 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '46%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 10 }}>特征重要性（随机森林）</Text>
      <Chart
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 320 }}
        chartType='barChart'
        barDirection='bar'
        title=''
        showLegend={false}
        showDataLabels={true}
        dataLabelColor='#1A2230'
        axisColor='#8B97A8'
        colors={['#1E4FA8']}
        data={[
          ['特征', '重要性'],
          ['src_bytes', 0.28],
          ['failed_logins', 0.16],
          ['packet_count', 0.14],
          ['num_unique_ports', 0.11],
          ['dst_bytes', 0.09],
          ['duration', 0.04],
          ['bytes_per_packet', 0.03],
          ['syn_rate', 0.01],
          ['protocol_type', 0.00],
        ]}
      />
      <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          前三特征（字节量、失败登录、包数）与攻击机理一致，证明特征设计有效。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 10 }}>9 维连接级特征（参考 NSL-KDD 范式）</Text>
      <Table
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 430 }}
        defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 13, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
        defaultCellStyle={{ border: { left: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, top: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' } }, padding: 8 }}
        cells={[
          [{ text: '特征', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }, { text: '含义', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#fff' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } }],
          ['duration', '连接持续时间'],
          [{ text: 'src/dst_bytes', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '双向字节数', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }],
          ['packet_count', '包总数'],
          [{ text: 'failed_logins', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '失败登录次数', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }],
          ['num_unique_ports', '访问的不同端口数'],
          [{ text: 'syn_rate', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: 'SYN 包占比', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }],
          ['bytes_per_packet', '平均每包字节'],
          [{ text: 'protocol_type', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '协议类型', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }],
        ]}
      />
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>07 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
